      "writtenOn": "2026-09-29T17:15:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe we have an issue in `AccountCacheImpl` because the repository is opened at loading time, which is expensive. I see you\u0027re following the same pattern, but that pattern should be improved.\n\nReinterating the same issue here will make 2 classes to be improved rather than just one.",
